Provenance note
---------------
v5.0.2 is the last release of gradle/actions whose caching implementation is
MIT-licensed. From v6.0.0 onwards the caching implementation was extracted into
'gradle-actions-caching', a closed-source component governed by the Gradle
Technologies Terms of Use. This repository is seeded from the v5.0.2 source
tree only and deliberately contains no v6 code or artifacts. Do not merge,
cherry-pick or copy from gradle/actions v6 or later.

Third-party design attribution
------------------------------
The sharded cache-entry work in sources/src/caching/ was informed by the
layered-cache approach in burrunan/gradle-cache-action (Apache-2.0):

    https://github.com/burrunan/gradle-cache-action

No code was copied from that project; the sharding implementation here is an
independent design based on Gradle's content-addressed cache directory layout.
